  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v9.2.0 — POCO convenience layer. FromObject(poco) on INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE reflects properties automatically. FromObjects(items) for multi-row bulk INSERT (single VALUES clause). QBatch combines multiple parameterized statements into one round-trip with automatic parameter collision renaming. New attributes: [QKey] routes property to WHERE on UPDATE/DELETE; [QIgnore] skips a property everywhere; [QColumn(\"name\")] overrides the SQL column name. Shorthand methods InsertFrom/UpdateFrom/DeleteFrom on QBuilder. Anonymous object support. 81 new tests (255 total).",
